    "updated_at": "2025-03-07T09:39:39Z",
    "body": "This was introduced in https://github.com/whatwg/html/commit/38139b40d9b808c9bc8646df74c5c075ad7584fe in order to fix #982.\n\nhttps://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=156115 also has some discussion, but no clearly associated code changes. I did not go digging into WebKit further.\n\nIt seems like @beidson might have opinions on when to throw and not throw though.\n\nMaybe @mfreed7 can copy the relevant Chromium engineer?",
