    "updated_at": "2025-03-13T02:09:31Z",
    "body": "I don't really have an opinion.\n\nI guess the question is whether anyone in Chromium is willing to sign up for the work of shipping such a change. So far @noamr and @natechapin slightly prefer not throwing, and so I don't think they're interested. I'm not sure what hat you're speaking with, @domfarolino, but if you want to take on that work then that would change the calculus.",
