    "created_at": "2025-03-13T08:15:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-03-13T08:15:30Z",
    "body": "> Chromium's behavior is rather unfortunate. Having unreliable APIs where caller can't know whether the expected operation succeeded or not should be avoided in the platform, IMO.\n\nI agree and if I was to design this API today I'd probably lean towards throwing.\n\nYears after this API has been shipped, I'm afraid that the added breakage for users of existing sites would be slightly greater than the added predictability for developers.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
