    "created_at": "2025-03-14T17:36:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-03-14T17:36:01Z",
    "body": "We definitely have not seen lots of breakage in Gecko, and I don't expect webkit has either.\n(Often we change the spec to follow what two or three out of three engines do, especially when people consider the behavior being more reasonable)",
